<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Softline buys Multisoft in 25 mln rand deal.</title>
<headline>Softline buys Multisoft in 25 mln rand deal.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Softline Ltd on Friday announced it had acquired the business of Multisoft SA (Pty) Ltd for a purchase consideration of 25.7 million rand.</p>
<p>The transaction will be satisfied by a share issue of Softline ordinary shares, 12.96 million rand and the transfer of 6.49 million rand into escrow.</p>
</text>
